That's one way to get there. Another way is to throw away the returned `ConfigMap` if `err` is non-nil:
```go
cm, err = cml.Client.ConfigMaps(cml.ConfigMapMeta.Namespace).Update(ctx, cml.cm, metav1.UpdateOptions{})
if err == nil {
	cml.cm = cm
}
return err
```
Alternately, if you don't mind `else`:
```go
if cm, err = cml.Client.ConfigMaps(cml.ConfigMapMeta.Namespace).Update(ctx, cml.cm, metav1.UpdateOptions{}); err != nil {
	return err
} else {
	cml.cm = cm
	return nil
}
```

